### SQLite ###
# Generated database files differ per machine/test run — never commit these.
# The SQLite JDBC driver jar under lib/ IS committed on purpose (no Maven/
# Gradle in this project, so every teammate needs the same jar available).
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

